  "title": "Residuating morphism record",
  "description": "Morphism: a residuated-lattice presentation (carrier + order + monoid, residual tables absent) -> the completed residuated-lattice with its left and right residual tables derived from the order and fusion and verified against the Lambek residuation law a*b <= c iff b <= a\\c iff a <= c/b. Fails if the structure is not a lattice, not a monoid, fusion is non-monotone, or no residual satisfies the law (i.e. the fusion is not residuated).",
